OpenNCALayer is an independent reimplementation of the NCALayer protocol. It is
not affiliated with or endorsed by the National Certification Authority of the
Republic of Kazakhstan. "NCALayer" is used only to describe compatibility.

Test fixtures fetched by `cargo xtask fetch-fixtures` come from NCANode
(https://github.com/ncanode-kz/NCANode) and are not redistributed in this
repository.

